========================================
Post-install Checklist
========================================

1. Clone the automation repository:
   git clone https://github.com/zmartsoledu/ubuntu_configure.git ~/ubuntu_configure

2. Run the staged post-install scripts:
   cd ~/ubuntu_configure/post_install
   sudo ./1_a_user_psswd_mods.sh
   # Continue with the remaining scripts as documented in post_install/README.md

3. Keep the repository up to date:
   cd ~/ubuntu_configure
   git pull

4. Configure networking
       - Edit /etc/netplan/*.yaml so each interface has optional: true. Example:  network:
           version: 2
           ethernets:
             enp0s31f6:
               dhcp4: true
               optional: true
           wifis:
             wlp3s0:
               access-points:
                 "YourSSID":
                   password: "YourPassphrase"
               dhcp4: true
               optional: true
       - Apply with sudo netplan apply. “Optional” tells systemd-networkd to skip the boot wait even if the link never appears.

Happy building!
